From 403e14194ce6b88c41411deb3b784dc9d4b85182 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Charlie Ball <cball8475@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Jul 2026 00:00:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Address Ash's dashboard feedback across tabs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Detail: fix scroll-freeze (add min-height:0 to #content flex child so the
form scrolls to the bottom without needing a field entered first).

Car Wash: number of washes now auto-tabulates (count × price per wash) with
a live total — no manual calculate step. Price prefills per wash type.

Wholesale + Auctions: merged into one tab. Added Reconditioning, Freight,
and Auction/Buyer Fee cost fields plus Sold Price / Sold To / Sold Date.
Each car is one deal: unsold cars are tracked as inventory (capital tied
up, excluded from net) and only realized margin on sold cars flows to the
balance, so wholesale gross no longer skews the real numbers. Added a
Wholesale/Auctions summary (inventory vs realized margin). Added AFC and
Next Gear Capital as payment methods.

Rentals: replaced free-text period with a start/end date range and
clarified the payout field ("what you got paid") with helper text.

Also: month list now runs from June 2026 through the current month with a
selector, so entries made in the current month are visible (previously
pinned to June only).
